cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this data, please cite it using the metadata below. Prefer the Zenodo DOI once one exists (see README), pinned to the version you actually used."
title: "ibahasa Research Data"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Huda"
    given-names: "M. Khoirul"
    website: "https://mkhuda.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ibahasa/research-data"
url: "https://ibahasa.com/riset"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >
  Raw data behind ibahasa research. Every figure published at ibahasa.com/riset
  links back to a file in this repository, pinned to the commit it was cited
  at. See INDEX.md for the full list of datasets and README.md for layout,
  citation permalink format, and the limits of each dataset.
keywords:
  - indonesian language
  - natural language processing
  - computational linguistics
  - language benchmark
  - corpus
  - regional languages
